# src/config/agent_config.json IS committed, but with every credential field
# blanked — it is the fallback layer the image bakes in so a pod always has
# AUTH_SERVICE_URL/model/instructions and never dies at import. The real
# values live in local/ below and are delivered at deploy time via
# CONFIG_JSON or a mount at /app/config/agent_config.json.
local/
